## Why This Is Asked
Tests advanced knowledge of cross-process allocators, NUMA optimization, and concurrent systems design. Evaluates ability to balance performance, locality, and memory efficiency in shared memory environments.

## Key Concepts
- NUMA-aware memory placement
- Cross-process shared memory coordination
- Lock-free algorithms and atomic operations
- Fragmentation mitigation strategies
- Hierarchical caching for performance optimization

## Implementation Outline
